{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "dde11be37d979000309041e99394111bb0dd67d6ad03189b736bf9ce1431e2fe", "ja": "ただ溢れ、流れゆくもの", "zh": "只是满溢、流逝之物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ce768730dcc98b6cbcb99fe9866bcebba6d44965060ad71c6002a72f2fae94bd", "ja": "まつりのヒントを受けて、プロデューサーと\n一緒に可奈を呼び出した志保。急に歌う理由\nを尋ねるが、可奈にはよくわからない。しか\nし一緒に過ごすうちに、可奈は、伝えたい気\n持ちが溢れて歌になると返すのだった。", "zh": "在获得祭的提示后，志保和制作人一起叫来了可奈。她询问可奈突然唱歌的理由，可奈却不太明白。然而，在一同度过时光的过程中，可奈回答说，想要传达的心情满溢而出，就变成了歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "964737e349aa2dcc957f4a75fedd49532277ac13f0f9ffaf5d845326de7320c1", "ja": "（今日のレッスンは休みだが、志保が何かに\n付き合ってほしいらしい。けど、なんだろう？）", "zh": "（今天虽然不用上课，但志保好像想让我陪她做些什么。不过，到底是什么呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6f51d852f5ca12fe81239daa4f149d03ec17e1f26b9f3114541d148c4564d3ba", "ja": "お疲れさま、志保。\nあれ、可奈も一緒なのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，志保。\n咦，可奈也一起来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "9432fca73540297d652200f352d97911c183e5ad850633e358f87e3cac09b132", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\nはいっ、志保ちゃんに呼ばれて来ました！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！  \n是的！是志保叫我来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "6ee39032540c45b0a4d260893a56aa137d5356575959a2790f8fe26f69ed64bc", "ja": "ミュージカル公演の……歌織さんの宿題のことで、\n可奈に意見を聞かせてもらおうと思って。", "zh": "关于音乐剧演出的……歌织的作业，我想听听可奈的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b28c402f36fdf62a844b89e90f9aadd1928f99b4bea0c507099ab37da3d13a24", "ja": "なるほど、可奈に……。\nうん、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊，是要问可奈……  \n嗯，我觉得挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "667daa4f7ab02fc4dd5c02e486a6ca28652f1147c74e1177687312aca2a3e90b", "ja": "えっ、ミュージカル公演のこと……？\nでも志保ちゃん、私、ミュージカルやったことないよ？", "zh": "诶，你是说音乐剧公演……？\n可是志保，我从来没演过音乐剧呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "ee18c6e6dc7b67ceee4fa11d313aee09810d8a2aecba9d810b17faf6091acc85", "ja": "そうじゃなくて。可奈はいつも、急に歌い出すでしょ。\n何を考えて、どういう意図で歌っているのかと思って。", "zh": "不是那个意思。可奈你总是突然唱起歌来吧。\n我只是想知道，你是怎么想的，又是出于什么意图才唱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "7a75694e5f05fea75a3f6fbbb955e30a537bc37ec503a78d291436ab18018311", "ja": "い、意図かぁ……。\nそう言われてもな～。う～ん……。", "zh": "意、意图啊……。\n你这么说我也很难回答呀～。嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "d34c0097b9a0235a0691c52efa8aa6c345f9796be97e74edf9d4ff97d3dd3f57", "ja": "なんか、自然と出てくるっていうか、\n気がついたら歌い出してるっていうか、そんな感じ？", "zh": "总觉得，应该说是自然而然就唱出来了吧，\n回过神来已经开始唱了……大概就是这种感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "4e825c3caa0a9e28d0d3a3dde1647a34df98d1f263c32ed152a05639bbcbedc6", "ja": "それが、どんな感じかわからないから、\nこうして質問しているんだけど。", "zh": "因为我不知道那到底是什么感觉，才会这样问你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "cee677661d997671145cf6324fd37c80f7453993fb4de997cd89209292d35e7f", "ja": "だ、だよね～。あははは……。", "zh": "对、对吧～。啊哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "52207d382074be9d7490cba4141b02ce361e401d3b178be1f7478287476f8e96", "ja": "まあまあ……今日はふたりとも、\nレッスンも休みだったよな？　なら、時間はあるだろ。", "zh": "好了好了……今天你们两个也都没上训练课吧？那应该有时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "78a1524234dbb6892d91ebb21f22a5db72bba7b9ea70124dde6f3614f1a2dfda", "ja": "可奈が歌い出したり、歌いたい気分になったら、\nその時に聞いてみるといいんじゃないか？", "zh": "等可奈开始唱歌，或者想唱歌的时候，到那时再听听看，不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "e126330831574cc92ccb6b2b115f78b921e332359b73f8dbc69db605dcf1629f", "ja": "そうですね……じゃあ可奈、待たせてもらうわ。\n歌が浮かんだら、その時の気持ちを教えて。いい？", "zh": "是啊……那我就等可奈了。\n要是浮现出什么歌，就把那时的心情告诉我，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "da843207504c6a49a8a335a7f5834bd3d3c8310278ea078621c56b62023e4800", "ja": "う、うん……でも、あの……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……可是，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "843f652aceab0ad2de0142cfbfb2c17050abc7750efd11e7113e45faa235da1d", "ja": "可奈、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "可奈，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "92f8e4a475d24583d6514d3112c0d5020e3c7a4559c0779f39b34b3b8bdb56f0", "ja": "えっと……わ、わあーっ！　無理！　無理無理！！\nそんなにジッと見られたら、緊張するよ～～！", "zh": "那个……哇、哇啊——！不行！不行不行！！\n一直被你这样盯着看，我会紧张的啦～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "272b2f6530eb0d28fa8260b7316f1928228335272cb15a38d77539996302ecde", "ja": "あ。\n……そ、そうよね、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "啊。\n……对、对哦，抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f8a511d3143ea80591e16ab1740663c813a730e8cb3742270ba3115ee2c703de", "ja": "それなら、楽しい事でもして、リラックスしよう。\n可奈、どこか行きたいところはあるか？", "zh": "那就做点开心的事，放松一下吧。\n可奈，你有没有什么想去的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "14d310f387f95e356f31ac9b457114b3a82778e9ca4c28bb0aaf1132899903b6", "ja": "わぁっ、いいんですか！？　えーっと……\nじゃあ私、パンケーキ食べに行きたいです！", "zh": "哇，可以吗！？那个……\n那我想去吃松饼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "68140789f0f5944c52200523706aa5916f9ac3b5eb2d797535258cbe847909b1", "ja": "わかった、パンケーキだな。ご馳走するよ。\n志保も、それでいいか？", "zh": "知道了，是松饼吧。我请客。\n志保，这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "2fd02ce3636d956b15971e115a1a749f9cfeb8a205970c3891632e9f00ebdce4", "ja": "お願いしてるのはこっちですから。\nどこにでも付き合います。", "zh": "是我在拜托你们。\n去哪儿我都奉陪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "8e7a10d9e515ba54037e51d8c7372634fd32b3cd08c72b620855a3fa0f3d4258", "ja": "よし、そうと決まれば行くぞ！", "zh": "好，既然决定了，那就出发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "498d7c576258bbd4950240597b5c073f2a8fc45bb91453e3d70766759ccfdf0e", "ja": "はいっ♪　やったぁ！　今日はご馳走、パンケーキ～♪\n{$P$}さん、景気いい～♪", "zh": "好♪ 太好了！今天有大餐，松饼～♪\n{$P$}先生，真阔气～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "609cae22199a441b237aacf81c769c704396f8dad8964736fd56e7929fc8f9e0", "ja": "あっ……待って、可奈！\n今、どんな気持ちで歌ったの？", "zh": "啊……等一下，可奈！\n你刚才唱歌时是什么心情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "7425538e1c0d156f8b1b4e8fc8daa0a01f06b2ff1ba6c24021e44d75995b08cf", "ja": "へっ？　……あ、そうだった！\nちょ、ちょっと待ってね。今、やってみるから！", "zh": "诶？……啊，对了！稍、稍微等我一下哦。我现在就试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "ceff023dddeb8397af3dc6f154555579a2af59e7c20edf4d5b1915f57100d253", "ja": "えっと～、えっと～……ううっ。\nじっと見られてると、出てこないよ～！", "zh": "那个～那个～……呜呜。\n一直被这样盯着看的话，就想不出来了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "47bc3bc0af6fb801dca0bfd0e28d90c82e51a55d70bbd6904db3d5734f6273a2", "ja": "やっぱり、自然に出た時じゃないとダメみたいだな……\n心配しなくても大丈夫だ、志保。まだ時間はあるから。", "zh": "果然，看来还是得在自然流露出来的时候才行啊……  \n别担心，志保。还来得及。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "54d216c50290c620addbb258d7a07208df02dc452eef9ee1e349de654325d025", "ja": "志保ちゃん……\n舞台の練習、うまくいってないの？", "zh": "志保……\n舞台排练得不顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "2443c67d6f2fc21fe10981a7b126b3fece390fd533603b844542072ba35e2f06", "ja": "全体としては、順調なほうだと思うけど……\nでも、だからって満足なんてしていられないわ。", "zh": "总体来说，我觉得还算顺利……不过，也不能因此就满足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "63ee05936bca13d3af3f4860616eab0d65570876cec4cbdb80f38e71005c2587", "ja": "みんながいろいろ世話を焼いてくれるのも、\n主演としての私が、頼りないからだと思うし……。", "zh": "大家会这样为我操心，也是因为作为主演的我还不够可靠吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "240247e50d12b6ed69270f7b007b29331e73451cb9c2a5353e7bed4d84670cad", "ja": "え～！？　志保ちゃんが頼りなかったら、\n私なんてもっと大変だよ！", "zh": "诶～！？要是志保都不可靠了，那我岂不是更糟糕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "edfe000c45d730db26cf3044ca5b03df98ec99dfa6021d691302bd708cae8d1b", "ja": "志保はそう言うけど……でも、\nみんなにそう言われたわけじゃないんだろう？", "zh": "志保是这么说，但……不过，也不是所有人都这么说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "69fbedbe864ab6382c405b2dd3bd539e2e139c87e7431e5009b66bae55f88640", "ja": "そうですけど。……でも、食べ物や飲み物を\n勧められたり、悩みがないか聞かれたり。", "zh": "是这样没错。……但是，他们会劝我吃东西、喝饮料，\n还会问我有没有什么烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "014c6c4368374577a8f22c1745743f3f4b42605ff99e938e007bd92d2d41f6f1", "ja": "遊園地で、キーホルダーを買ってもらったり……\nなんだか小さい子みたいな扱いをされている気がして。", "zh": "还会在游乐园给我买钥匙扣……\n总觉得自己被当成小孩子对待了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "bb0daac62ded798ee927414c197f0d7deae74291c149fc66785d103b0edab139", "ja": "えーっ？　それって、みんな志保ちゃんのことが\nカワイイってだけじゃないの？", "zh": "诶——？那不就是因为大家都觉得志保很可爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "a9b6db9e2caffac4393718fa4fd0909169177ff9a0c9b626714297363b749deb", "ja": "はあ？　そんなわけないでしょう。それに、\n私はかわいいって言われるようなタイプじゃないわ。", "zh": "哈？怎么可能。而且，我也不是那种会被人说可爱的类型。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1038_036kan", "source_sha256": "16d600f9065ca6f3f1e45686df3dd775a5abe76c249053c138a6ee7357c15b32", "ja": "そんなわけあるよ！　だって志保ちゃんカワイイもん！\nそうですよね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "当然有这种可能啊！因为志保很可爱嘛！\n对吧，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "0b4d5cac9b656c163c9583fb89dfdca8ac5d507c2d5f27c48b14d3446ba6a80f", "ja": "うん、そうだな。俺も可奈と同じで、\n志保は可愛いところがあると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。我也和可奈一样，觉得志保有可爱的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "4b31666a6b2d88dd7dffa91e6769f17d6dee9cc69943b82d5658f2fda69f3b56", "ja": "ふたりとも、何言ってるんですか？　はぁ……。", "zh": "你们两个在说什么呢？唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1041_036kan", "source_sha256": "8829e81fb54b290b3f05940fc8337fe713f503fee544c66d24156384b72630f0", "ja": "信じてなーい！　もっとちゃんと聞いてよ～！\n志保ちゃんは、志保ちゃんは……えーっと～……。", "zh": "才不信呢——！你再认真听听嘛～！\n小志保，小志保她……那个～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1042_036kan", "source_sha256": "0217496d95a9c5ec18f44692ca9e814039dcb94c4f61ef6ee28783f01816f40b", "ja": "志保ちゃんは～♪　かわいいんだ～♪\nカッコイイところも～いっぱいあるけど～♪", "zh": "志保很可爱～♪\n虽然也有很多～帅气的地方～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1043_036kan", "source_sha256": "6d5f9a520fdea37c1fb882b07cc57b7a230de56fb40ab8c1b279265cf9ae0456", "ja": "楽屋で、ぬいぐるみと見つめ合って～♪\nちょびっと笑った顔が、すっごくいいんだ～♪", "zh": "在后台，和玩偶深情对望～♪\n微微一笑的表情，真的特别棒～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1044_p", "source_sha256": "4b7af52b1af9b35e7b9d2e0002c8fdabbfb2c20070bd559b6c8d7661f6e1bee4", "ja": "あっ。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1045_036kan", "source_sha256": "230056cf52b5c90b4fdf3106f82007dc5f3f646666002619ffa62730744d9226", "ja": "あ！　つい、歌っちゃいました……えへへ。", "zh": "啊！一不小心就唱出来了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "e0bf392fd7a8e73debc1f3c415767a991556d2dbb822eaf0bc8e8f68e7326c8c", "ja": "はぁ……まあいいわ。それで、どうだったの？\n歌が浮かんだとき、何を考えてた？", "zh": "哈……那就算了。然后，感觉怎么样？\n脑海中浮现出歌曲时，你在想什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1047_036kan", "source_sha256": "645d998610b9a595ed79df1766e918db1cb8c7468fb09a8e7752e34f0e981e02", "ja": "はれっ？　考え……？\nゴ、ゴメ～ン！！　なんにも考えてなかった～！", "zh": "诶？想法……？\n对、对不起～！！我什么都没想～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1048_036kan", "source_sha256": "86c8dc293665a8c7ba252b72e9707d189fa05cbce37e1102af2179c1aa601fab", "ja": "私、志保ちゃんにわかってほしいな～って気持ちで、\n頭がいっぱいで……なんとかして伝えたいなって……。", "zh": "我满脑子都在想着，希望志保能理解我……想着要怎么把这份心情传达给她……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "2234a3f55ebabf846b0336e8c4c2474dce08e7c208a966029f0ced3c23b6c8b9", "ja": "伝える……？", "zh": "想传达……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1050_p", "source_sha256": "4a24383abd4b3c71c33794e757744531edef0bd557438718e9c02b4d408e23d9", "ja": "そうか。可奈は「伝えたい」という気持ちで\n心がいっぱいになると、思わず歌っちゃうんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。可奈一旦满心都是“想要传达”的心情，就会忍不住唱起歌来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1051_036kan", "source_sha256": "9854709a3b3a4d2f71895bfd66057a201b184c536c1c48b0950698f61f4f1d3a", "ja": "あっ、そういうことですね！\n{$P$}さん、さすが～♪", "zh": "啊，原来是这样！\n{$P$}先生，不愧是你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1052_033sih", "source_sha256": "558ee61455b46f7444cf4362e6656d7f54153b02d4f229da35d66bed4005538d", "ja": "伝えたい気持ちで……心がいっぱいになる……。\nなんだか、少しだけ理解できたかも……。", "zh": "想要传达的心情……让心里满满的……\n不知怎么的，我好像稍微理解了一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1053_036kan", "source_sha256": "7942cc4eb5df67898255bfc191e7ac09595dd7c8b5db2363b398ecabec72742f", "ja": "えーっ！？　志保ちゃん、ホント！？\n私、役に立ったのかな？", "zh": "诶——！？志保，真的吗！？\n我帮上忙了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1054_033sih", "source_sha256": "9fe722b1cd9f48b8ce4864aabedceb2aec7114325b09bd20d9e34b7725ccd5b2", "ja": "ええ。ありがとう、可奈。それから……\n{$P$}さんも。", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你，可奈。还有……{$P$}先生也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_05_1055_p", "source_sha256": "0b546a79991310e449b821fdeb76703eb39b243e933aca0cac607946d57f2a7d", "ja": "（その後、ふたりは仲良くパンケーキを食べた。\n今回の公演は、上手くいく気がするな……）", "zh": "（之后，两人亲亲热热地吃了松饼。\n总觉得这次公演会顺利进行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
